        - import ConfigParseError from ports_adapters.ports
        - catch ConfigParseError and raise ConfigAssembly with original exception as cause
        [x] 'content/render_pipeline/render_service.py'
            - all good, nothing to do
        [x] 'content/tui/tui_service.py'
            - all good, nothing to do

